WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.000
Lesson 10.6 · Legal, Compliance, Policies & Risk
Data protection and privacy

2
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:11.800
Build data protection in from the first sign-up: it is far easier than fixing it later.

3
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.600
1. List what data you will collect, why and where it lives.

4
00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:18.200
2. Keep only what you need, and only as long as needed.

5
00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:22.200
3. Give children’s and sensitive data extra protection.

6
00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:24.600
You build your data inventory and list your privacy actions.

7
00:00:24.600 --> 00:00:28.600
Then save it, and download it as a PDF.

8
00:00:30.100 --> 00:00:33.200
Method into Impact
Better foundations. Stronger organisations.
